    441  f206							; TitleIntro — intro-screen ($FD) edge check. Entered by JMP from DropStep
    442  f206							; (no pending return; tail-jumps out — never rts, or it would pop a stale
    443  f206							; frame return). Any SELECT/RESET press (level-triggered, prev-released via
    444  f206							; StepsLeft): DropTarget=$FF (old title) + jsr DropArm (.DATitle pose/score
    445  f206							; — the room is ALREADY loaded from boot LoadLevel, no deep LoadLevel:
    446  f206							; stack depth DropStep→TitleIntro→DropArm keeps sim_bomb_fuse min-SP).
    447  f206							; Always re-samples StepsLeft (title-owned on intro/title frames;
    448  f206							; RefreshEnemyY's idle-only guard never touches it during gameplay... its
    449  f206							; gameplay latch writes StepsLeft only when DropTarget==0 — intro frames
    450  f206							; have DropTarget=$FD so ownership stays clean).
    451  f206							; Clobbers A/X/Temp. Ends at TitleTailAudio (silence + overscan wait).
    452  f206							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
